1454
02:51:54,152 --> 02:51:57,432
Art terapi'yi kime uyguluyorsunuz ya da etkileri nedir?

1455
02:51:57,531 --> 02:51:59,131
Daha sonra bundan bahsetmemiz lazım.

1456
02:52:00,572 --> 02:52:01,871
What is art terapi?

1457
02:52:01,871 --> 02:52:03,871
Art terapi'yi kime uyguluyorsunuz.

1458
02:52:03,871 --> 02:52:05,871
Psycho-therapyyi kime uyguluyorsunuz.

1459
02:52:05,871 --> 02:52:18,691
That is generally used for isolated people, such as cancer patients or let's say prisoners or the patients in isolation in general.

1460
02:52:18,691 --> 02:52:30,231
So at the end of it, it may have many benefits such as decreasing the depression or anxiety levels of the people.

1461
02:52:30,231 --> 02:52:43,731
